{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_005_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cad896a6dac4ec45f10244c86d191fe0a293e9bb5c3ff281b5d7c987dfedfb87",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86615981dce0118d92137806b794896b169627f29eb71024f135aeede9dbabc0",
      "text": "原来你在这里啊。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3650b0fc8db5fb9cd3e99158c8353534a2da4eb31c7dc9294cbf1c2d4e76c85c",
      "text": "并不是什么特别要紧的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1b25fb40016af984193a9201213d8d7a6e23a9108b221ef41e536db368e62d7",
      "text": "只是想把情人节收到的巧克力的\n回礼交给你罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21277fbbae8e333799a0e7cdb84e4cffd18146553f2c6891e24c66ed30a41d8c",
      "text": "你那是什么表情……我也是懂得\n这种程度的礼节和分寸的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:636e3fe0edc094800fd353c5496e8669bb0b2f60ff6466f28b8c23e34d935216",
      "text": "少废话，老老实实收下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:467a5459bde8b8f81b3e6aee59b0af2e0d1598c7c00b13f79013273381b3912a",
      "text": "让我好找啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n这是情人节的谢礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed5395839e2bb06efa933ec6d99032b84c2182696542d321d8b9321a65484ed3",
      "text": "毕竟在情人节那天，\n从你那里收到了巧克力啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4197f44daf142c6390d62e6b3348a880ee1cd91e37f5739a044b1839a41b800c",
      "text": "用不着客气，收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2def92488adfd22b86c3ccb53c8d5c96968953f66c5d4ea4d2a63a63bb2714e0",
      "text": "居然能收到回礼……非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd95f592b7ce0b1c60919d300d9dc1c38e3075d27ca308308244153b76f8f864",
      "text": "承蒙你的这份心意，我很开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cde53de239286894957f8a1a8b91f5a73c2fe92b58ed42ad75cf777952f3a5f",
      "text": "虽然未曾料想过自己竟会参与进这种\n无聊的节日活动里来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:134ac2baccab5748274be9df113b7f12e133cabdc785b9f76edae20454f7b630",
      "text": "罢了。\n反正也不是什么大不了的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a935e2a2410f31426a71646c6377a97d74f79fa78f79241f17fb83e6938c549",
      "text": "况且，对于一直以来承蒙关照的你，\n要是光顾着收下礼物，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf0abda586f7262b8ece44d1857423c951777d25298c6c0cca009e985387e193",
      "text": "却不作任何回礼也是说不过去的吧。\n我可还没不知礼数到那个地步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f848650fb2f2aa5d963f8a036c1a3b4d0da9f6e7cb816c4e2ba3cf4268e30bd5",
      "text": "事情办完了。\n我去上训练课了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_22:5_02_005_22_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:730def8e3d787c595ee1a8e169f3d11ec5251fa3cc295af2b17aecbc0290d127",
      "text": "你也适度穿插休息，\n然后再回去工作吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
